cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "bioc-support-archive: a static archive of the Bioconductor support site"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Sean
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8991-6458"
    affiliation: "University of Colorado Anschutz Medical Campus"
abstract: >-
  Tools to convert the database of support.bioconductor.org, the Bioconductor community's
  question-and-answer site (2001-2026), into a static, searchable, read-only archive that keeps
  the original URLs. The pipeline restores a PostgreSQL dump, exports a privacy-filtered public
  subset, renders static HTML with a Pagefind search index, and serves it from Cloudflare R2
  through a Cloudflare Worker.
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/seandavi/bioc-support-archive"
url: "https://bioc-support-archive.seandavi.workers.dev"
keywords:
  - Bioconductor
  - web archive
  - static site
  - Cloudflare Workers
  - Pagefind
